---
// Cadastro = waitlist. O `action` é placeholder até decidirmos backend
// (Supabase, Formspree, ou rota Astro `prerender = false`).
---

<section
  id="cadastro"
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-paper/10"
  aria-labelledby="cadastro-titulo"
>
  {/* Slow-orbiting gradient orbs */}
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div
      class="orb animate-orbit-slow-cw"
      style="
        top: 5%; left: 10%;
        width: 500px; height: 500px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232,93,38,0.20) 0%, transparent 60%);
      "
    ></div>
    <div
      class="orb animate-orbit-slow-ccw"
      style="
        bottom: 0%; right: 10%;
        width: 460px; height: 460px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,179,71,0.16) 0%, transparent 60%);
      "
    ></div>
    <div
      class="orb animate-breath"
      style="
        top: 30%; left: 40%;
        width: 380px; height: 380px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,122,69,0.14) 0%, transparent 65%);
      "
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24 text-center md:py-32" data-reveal-stagger>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange">
      Lista de espera
    </p>
    <div class="relative mt-3 inline-block overflow-hidden rounded-md">
      <h2
        id="cadastro-titulo"
        class="relative font-display text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-paper md:text-6xl"
      >
        Os primeiros 100 entram no beta.
      </h2>
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
        style="background: linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 35%, rgba(232,93,38,0.22) 50%, transparent 65%); animation: sheen 1500ms ease-out 400ms both; mix-blend-mode: screen;"
      ></span>
    </div>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-paper/70 md:text-xl">
      Cadastre seu email e a gente te chama assim que abrir uma vaga. Sem
      spam. Você pode sair quando quiser.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-orange/25 bg-orange/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-orange">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange"></span>
      Grátis durante o beta fechado · sem cartão
    </p>

    <div
      data-waitlist
      data-state="idle"
      data-boom-host
      class="boom-host mx-auto mt-10 w-full max-w-xl"
    >
      <form
        novalidate
        class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"
        aria-describedby="waitlist-status"
      >
        <label class="sr-only" for="email-cadastro">Email</label>
        <input
          id="email-cadastro"
          type="email"
          name="email"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          inputmode="email"
          placeholder="seu@email.com"
          class="flex-1 rounded-full border border-paper/15 bg-paper/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-base text-paper placeholder:text-paper/40 transition-all focus:border-orange focus:bg-paper/[0.07] focus:shadow-glow focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-60"
        />
        <input type="hidden" name="origem" value="landing-pt-br" />
        <input
          type="text"
          name="_gotcha"
          tabindex="-1"
          autocomplete="off"
          class="hidden"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          data-magnetic
          class="btn-shine inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-paper shadow-glow-soft transition-colors hover:bg-orange-hover disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-paper"
        >
          Quero entrar
        </button>
      </form>

      <p
        id="waitlist-status"
        data-form-status
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
        class="mt-3 min-h-[1.25rem] text-sm font-medium data-[tone=good]:text-paper data-[tone=bad]:text-flame data-[tone=muted]:text-paper/55"
      ></p>

      {/* Submit boom particles */}
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="boom-dot"></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="boom-dot"></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="boom-dot"></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="boom-dot"></span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="boom-dot"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-paper/50">
      A gente respeita LGPD. Email só para te avisar do beta, nada além disso.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
